#N canvas 50 50 1100 500 10;
#X text 20 5 DM48X Tunings - send .mid tuning files to the Lekholm DM48X;
#X text 20 22 1) Put .mid files in this patch folder. 2) On the DM48X: Tuning editor > Receive tuning.;
